         Inner Lookups: per outer batch
         Hash Cond: (l.id = o.k)
         ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on ij_outer o
         ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on ij_inner l
               Lookup Index: ij_inner_pkey
               Lookup Key: id
(8 rows)

